// Single source of truth of the autopilot process: requirements, stories, statuses.
// `npm run dashboard` validates it and regenerates manifest.md, spec.md, state.json
// and dashboard.html. Edit this file, never the generated files.
//
// Requirement kinds
//   brief      quote from the user's first message (verbatim when verbatim === true)
//   followup   requirement the user added later by sending screenshots of the reference project
//   implied    something the brief does not say but a working game needs
// Story status: done | partial | placeholder | deferred
// Story verified: tests (node tests) | browser (checked in the running game) | static (script analysis of a file) | review (independent agent) | code (read, not run) | pending
// A requirement is as done as its weakest story.

